        "created_at": "2019-11-02T01:45:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not a big deal, but found a typo. In&nbsp;\"After Scion Voss flips, if a hero has been incapacitated, their \"before the start of turn\" options are restricted. They cannot take on objectives, swap our or trade objectives, or regain rewards. They can shuffle the mission deck.\" -- \"our\" should be \"out\".&nbsp;</p>",
