      {
        "id": 229062,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-11-06T03:20:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, gosh, I can’t believe I’ve been playing this wrong the whole time…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The Fireside Chat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n The Fireside Chat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You may wonder: can they be&nbsp;selected to be played in OblivAeon mode when replacing a hero, or as the Representative of Earth?&nbsp;<em>What cards? I don’t know what cards you’re&nbsp;talking about - they don’t exist anymore. What you are contractually obligated to do whenever something says “remove [a card] from the game” is&nbsp;tear it up and burn the remains.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:42.356Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
