        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Oh, gosh, I can't believe I've been playing this wrong the whole time........\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[quote=\"The Fireside Chat\"]\n\nYou may wonder: can they be&nbsp;selected to be played in OblivAeon mode when replacing a hero, or as the Representative of Earth?&nbsp;<em>What cards? I don’t know what cards you’re&nbsp;talking about - they don’t exist anymore. What you are contractually obligated to do whenever something says “remove [a card] from the game” is&nbsp;tear it up and burn the remains.</em>\n\n[/quote]\n\n;)\n",
